    ],
    "text": "Showers will occur at times in the Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya Districts. Fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in Galle, Matara, Kaluthara and Rathnapura districts.",
